    {
        "Id": 10,
        "ActionId": 10,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Simon",
            "\"When the boulder finally wears the hill down, we will prove what being a hero really means.\"",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 11,
        "ActionId": 600,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 204,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 12,
        "ActionId": 11,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Both of you give a relieved smile as Simon continues to recite your speech—"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 13,
        "ActionId": 12,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "\"Sisyphus was compelled to devote his entire life to a futile endeavor. That boulder was a necessary price that he must pay over and over again for the world.\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 14,
        "ActionId": 13,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "\"He was exhausting every possible means to fight the punishment given by the gods and fate itself.\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 15,
        "ActionId": 14,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "\"Our endeavor, like that of Sisyphus, is always at risk of being overturned back to the starting point by fate, by a past full of suffering and a future full of uncertainties.\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 16,
        "ActionId": 15,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "\"The land we reclaimed yesterday could be buried under the Red Tide tomorrow. The expectation we have for tomorrow could be torn apart by the Punishing Virus today.\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 17,
        "ActionId": 16,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "\"But we will continue to fight through these inevitable, recurring cycles, to make our lives meaningful.\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 18,
        "ActionId": 17,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "\"When the boulder finally wears the hill down, we will prove what being a hero really means.\""
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 18,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "But we are still far from being \"heroes.\"",
            19
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 20,
        "ActionId": 19,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Simon",
            "I don't want to be pushed to become some sort of hero... I just have this feeling that the next step after that is to die and be written into textbooks.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 21,
        "ActionId": 20,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Simon",
            "Perhaps hearing you telling the truth made me happier than being a hero.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
        "ActionId": 21,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Simon",
            "Regardless of how the past and future unfold, they cannot run away from the truth, so we may as well just tell them. People must speak the truth to live on in an earnest way.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 23,
        "ActionId": 22,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Simon",
            "But you gave them hope on top of that. And that's very important.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 24,
        "ActionId": 23,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 202,
        "IsBlock": 0,
