    {
        "Id": 34,
        "ActionId": 33,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            "When Bambinata opens the Egret's door, she is no longer hesitant and fearful like before."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 35,
        "ActionId": 34,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "She just stands at the doorway quietly and gently like a cat that has been patiently waiting all along."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 36,
        "ActionId": 35,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "Hello...?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 37,
        "ActionId": 36,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "...Gray Raven Commandant?",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 38,
        "ActionId": 37,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Can you recognize me?",
            38
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 39,
        "ActionId": 38,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "She nods earnestly. In her blue eyes, you see a faint glimmer—a light that jumped into her clear, innocent eyes from somewhere else."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 40,
        "ActionId": 39,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 204,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 41,
        "ActionId": 40,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "Bambinata remembers your name, your look, and your voice.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 42,
        "ActionId": 41,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 204,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 43,
        "ActionId": 42,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "Bambinata doesn't remember what happened yesterday, but Bambinata remembers you.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 44,
        "ActionId": 43,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "It is a light that you had never seen before in this dream. Something has transcended time."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 45,
        "ActionId": 44,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 204,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1,
            4
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 46,
        "ActionId": 45,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "Bambinata tried to recall yesterday through your name... But Bambinata couldn't remember anything.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 47,
        "ActionId": 46,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "But Bambinata remembered her diary, so Bambinata was able to find those records of you.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 47,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "Here it says that tomorrow... I mean, today, you will be visiting Bambinata. So Bambinata has been waiting here for you.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 49,
        "ActionId": 48,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata shows you the note you left for her yesterday. She has already bound it into yesterday's diary."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 50,
        "ActionId": 49,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Perhaps that is what promises are all about. They can transcend time and become a never-changing part of memories."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 51,
        "ActionId": 50,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 302,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Let's go.",
            51
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 52,
        "ActionId": 51,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 204,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 53,
        "ActionId": 52,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Bambinata",
            "Yes, 【kuroname】.",
            1
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 54,
        "ActionId": 53,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Every day, Bambinata would start reading her diary again, starting from the first day in the past few days."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 55,
        "ActionId": 54,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "In other words, every day she would go through all the things she had gone through ever since the day you met her."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 56,
        "ActionId": 55,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "She does not filter the experiences though. Instead, she just remembers them all together, only for them to be forgotten again the next time."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 57,
        "ActionId": 56,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "Which means things like Vanessa's sarcasm and the inspector's incident would all be revised by her every time."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 58,
        "ActionId": 57,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
        "EndAnim": "AniZhuanchangBegin",
        "BeginDelay": 0.0,
        "EndDelay": 0.0,
        "Params": [
            "The advantage of keeping such meticulous records is probably that she can also remember those easily forgotten details for you."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 59,
        "ActionId": 58,
        "NextActionId": 0,
        "Type": 202,
        "IsBlock": 0,
        "IsEnd": 0,
